Rāvaṇa orders Indrajit to kill Rāma Lakṣmaṇa seen or unseen --- Indrajit kindles altar fire with goat offering and victory signs --- Indrajit mounts invisible chariot guarded by Brāhma weapon --- Indrajit vows to empty earth of monkeys and vanishes --- Unseen Indrajit rains shafts piercing Rāma Lakṣmaṇa in all limbs --- Princes cover sky yet fail to touch hidden Indrajit --- Lakṣmaṇa vows Brāhma weapon against all Rākṣasas --- Rāma forbids slaying noncombatants and hunts only trickster